aned and the day passed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l008","ordinal":270283,"en":"As fate would have it, the water ran out."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l009","ordinal":270284,"en":"Hey, my bottom, I'm running out of sun."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l010","ordinal":270285,"en":"Bereki has done a lot now"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l011","ordinal":270286,"en":"Try to cook"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l012","ordinal":270287,"en":"Lack of copper, copper,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l013","ordinal":270288,"en":"To the poor widow and orphan"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l014","ordinal":270289,"en":"Do it now."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l015","ordinal":270290,"en":"Go back and read the Qur'an"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l016","ordinal":270291,"en":"Today my heart is playing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l017","ordinal":270292,"en":"Guys, save your life!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l018","ordinal":270293,"en":"The dream was broken,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l019","ordinal":270294,"en":"A difficult conflict is a big problem"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l020","ordinal":270295,"en":"It is our work that makes people cringe."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l021","ordinal":270296,"en":"Hey, let's go around Kulchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l022","ordinal":270297,"en":"I have ninety horses in the mountains."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l023","ordinal":270298,"en":"You can't get enough of it"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l024","ordinal":270299,"en":"There is no scapula, tulsa black,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l025","ordinal":270300,"en":"Let me know if I freeze"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l026","ordinal":270301,"en":"Death has come, the day is over,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l027","ordinal":270302,"en":"The fate has come, I want to see,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l028","ordinal":270303,"en":"By the way, from Okuz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l029","ordinal":270304,"en":"Never come back to the real place"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l030","ordinal":270305,"en":"Let's say it's by chance"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l031","ordinal":270306,"en":"God willing to write"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l032","ordinal":270307,"en":"There is no way to raise it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l033","ordinal":270308,"en":"There is no boy in the back."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l034","ordinal":270309,"en":"It looks like nothing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l035","ordinal":270310,"en":"It seems like the world is shit."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l036","ordinal":270311,"en":"Am I as good as the river grass?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l037","ordinal":270312,"en":"Bleeding blood, not listening"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l038","ordinal":270313,"en":"There is no child to cry,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1099:b005:l039","ordinal":270314,"en":"Will I be like a fire extinguished?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l001","ordinal":270315,"en":"Kulchorom, do you have any news?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l002","ordinal":270316,"en":"My mind is broken"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l003","ordinal":270317,"en":"The letter I received a long time ago,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l004","ordinal":270318,"en":"In Tatarstan since Bukar"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l005","ordinal":270319,"en":"Kyzyr called Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l006","ordinal":270320,"en":"Since then it has returned"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l007","ordinal":270321,"en":"Aunt Chachykey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l008","ordinal":270322,"en":"The letter I received for shooting"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l009","ordinal":270323,"en":"I have never seen a child."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l010","ordinal":270324,"en":"Heart palpitations, heartburn,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l011","ordinal":270325,"en":"My mind is gone"},{"id":"semet